context:
DELETE /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/workers/routes/{route_id}
Deletes a Worker route.
Required: route_id (path); zone_id (path)

GET /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/workers/routes/{route_id}
Returns information about a Worker route, including URL pattern and Worker.
Required: route_id (path); zone_id (path)

PUT /client/v4/zones/{zone_id}/workers/routes/{route_id}
Replaces the URL pattern or Worker associated with a Worker route.
Required: route_id (path); zone_id (path); body (body)
